---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Mark Bransky | NASM-Certified Trainer in Pleasanton"
  description="Mark Bransky has spent nearly 20 years as a personal trainer and NASM educator, certifying and mentoring over 1,000 personal trainers while training clients in Pleasanton, CA."
  path="/about/"
  ogType="profile"
  ogTitle="About Mark Bransky | Bransky Fitness"
  ogImage="https://www.branskyfitness.com/images/mark-headshot.jpg"
  activeNav="about"
>

  <section class="page-intro facets">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Mark Bransky</h1>
      <p>Nice to meet you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="bio-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <figure class="about-figure">
          <img src="/images/mark-headshot.jpg" alt="Portrait of Mark Bransky, personal trainer at Bransky Fitness" width="1400" height="1400" loading="eager">
        </figure>

        <div>
          <h2 id="bio-heading">Welcome to my training business</h2>
          <p>I've spent nearly 20 years in the fitness industry, working as a personal trainer, educator, and mentor. It's been a hands-on journey, and I've been fortunate to help a lot of people along the way.</p>
          <p>My approach is rooted in real-world experience and evidence-based methods, with a focus on functional movement, strength and conditioning, and weight management. Over the years, I've helped certify and mentor more than a thousand personal trainers through the National Academy of Sports Medicine (NASM), and that part of the work continues to be a passion of mine.</p>
          <p>Whether you're someone looking to improve your health or a trainer trying to grow in this field, my goal is to help you move better, feel stronger, and stay consistent. I love this work, and I take pride in seeing clients and professionals alike succeed.</p>
          <p><strong>Let's get to work.</strong></p>

          <ul class="credential-list">
            <li>NASM-Certified Personal Trainer</li>
            <li>Certified and mentored 1,000+ personal trainers through NASM</li>
            <li>~20 years of coaching experience</li>
            <li>Private studio: 1040 Serpentine Lane, Suites 203/204, Pleasanton, CA</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="cta-heading">Work with Mark directly</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Let's Go!</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
